			Multitenancy carries the Finbuckle packages (IMultiTenantStrategy / IMultiTenantStore<T> /
			AppTenantInfo) used by the slug strategy + tenant store wiring (D-01). Referencing the
			implementation module is safe — it does NOT re-invoke AddMultiTenant<AppTenantInfo>() (Pitfall 1).
		-->
		<ProjectReference Include="..\..\Multitenancy\Modules.Multitenancy\Modules.Multitenancy.csproj" />
	</ItemGroup>

</Project>
